(text "RP2350B CORE BOARD (pins by GPIO number)" (at 124.46 165.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid f206c4ba-38f9-45f5-ae56-1cf9015e7b8a))
